// Tag - pulls enemy targeting away from real players (see EnemyMovementUtility.TryFindAggroTarget
// and EnemySystem's Idle/Chasing target-acquisition). Sits on the same physics layer as a real
// player (baked on the prefab) so an enemy's attack hit-connect checks, which re-query "nearest
// thing on the Player layer" independently of Enemy.Target, actually land on it once in range.
//
// Lifespan is DestroyAfterTime's job, not this one's.
component Decoy
{
}
